  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Selection of a local organization in Nepal to implement the activities in earthquake affected districts in western Nepal. The purpose of this activity is to build resilience of the school communities, including preparation of the human resource for the recovery phase and continuation of schooling of affected students.</narrative>
  </description>
